                "textId": "Performance_501101_2127296930_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "我感觉好多了，喉咙不痛了，\n腿脚不酸了，连头也不晕了，\n这汤药喝过都说好咳、嚯！<style=SizeSmall>还是得收敛点。</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_501101_2127296930_content",
                "value": "我感觉好多了，喉咙不痛了，\n腿脚不酸了，连头也不晕了，\n这汤药喝过都说好咳、嚯！<style=SizeSmall>还是得收敛点。</style>",
