                "textId": "Performance_501101_2127296934_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A灵光一现}不如我们趁热打铁咳嚯，\n把今天的<style=Highlight>星球协理日报</style>写完——",
